// Locks the Add bar half of the UI Contract in
// docs/issues/06-frontend-board-add-bar.md — component contract:
//   <AddBar onCreated={(bookmark) => void} onTransientError={(message: string) => void} />
// AddBar owns POST /api/bookmarks and every inline (400/409) error
// presentation itself; it never touches board state directly. On success
// it calls onCreated with the created domain.Bookmark (App patches local
// state from that value — no GET /api/board refetch, see UI Contract
